<title>UK: GE Capital to buy UK's TLS for 68.2 mln stg.</title>
<headline>GE Capital to buy UK's TLS for 68.2 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. group GE Capital Corp  said it agreed to buy Britain's TLS Plc in a recommended cash offer valuing the car rental firm at about 68.2 million stg.</p>
<p>GE Capital, part of U.S. giant General Electric Co, said it would offer 135p cash per TLS share, with a loan note alternative.</p>
